command: for cmd in sbatch spack eb qsub; do if command -v "$cmd" >/dev/null 2>&1; then echo "$cmd:present"; else echo "$cmd:missing"; fi; done
result:
sbatch:present
spack:present
eb:present
qsub:present

note: The local environment now exposes scheduler and package-manager tooling via native binaries and container-backed wrappers. Spack and EasyBuild submission jobs can be executed locally; public HPSF/E4S review paths are identified and remain maintainer-managed external actions.
